<newsitem itemid="777431" id="root" date="1997-08-04" xml:lang="en">
<title>CHINA: Philippine Development Bank launches yen bond.</title>
<headline>Philippine Development Bank launches yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Securities (HK).</p>
<p> BORROWER DEVELOPMENT BANK OF THE PHILIPPINES</p>
<p> AMOUNT YEN 20 BLN	COUPON    3.15 PCT    MATURITY SEPT 2003</p>
<p> TYPE FIXED RATE NOTE   ISS PRICE 99.84	 SPREAD 110BP*</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  LAUNCH 04/AUG/97</p>
<p> LISTING   JAPAN	  REPAYMENT --	    REPLIES --</p>
<p> RATING    BA1/BBB***   SALES LMTS US/UK/HK/SINGAPORE/JAPAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   UK/JAPAN**   HOME CTRY PHILIPPINES PAY DATE 02/SEP/97</p>
<p> DENOMINATIONS 1 MLN YEN</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER   DAIWA SECURITIES (HK) LTD</p>
<p> FEES	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS 50 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>		    CO-MANAGERS	40 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>*OVER SIX-YEAR YEN/YEN SWAP TO YIELD 3.18 PCT</p>
<p>**LAW: ENGLISH (NOTES, TRUST DEED AND AGENCY AGREEMENT),</p>
<p>JAPANESE (SUBSCRIPTION AGREEMENT AND AGREEMENT AMONG MANAGERS)</p>
<p>***BA1 FROM MOODY'S INVESTORS SERVICE, BBB FROM JCR</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847-4043</p>
</text>
